      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s future museum will occupy the historic Sugar Mill Refinery office at 307 Iberia Street, a landmark slated to open in 2026.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.youngsvillehistorymuseum.com/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Youngsville Historical Preservation Society, founded in 2019, runs the museum as a 501(c)(3) nonprofit dedicated to safeguarding artifacts and oral histories.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.youngsvillehistorymuseum.com/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Volunteer curators and local schools partner with the museum to provide educational programs that bring Youngsville’s past to life for students and residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.youngsvillehistorymuseum.com/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Youngsville’s history reflects a rapid growth from a small settlement to a thriving community, a narrative highlighted on the city’s official website.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.youngsville.us/about-youngsville/youngsville-history/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The museum’s mission is to preserve photographs, artifacts, and memories before they’re lost, while inspiring future generations through exhibits and community events.",
